ا هدایت خواهد کرد"}}, {"text": "وَيُصْلِحُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَالَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "87:3", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5951.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Who measureth, then guideth;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Takdir edip hidayeti gösteren O'dur.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جس نے اندازہ پر رکھ کر راہ دی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan yang menentukan kadar (masing-masing) dan memberi petunjuk,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَدَّرَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَهَدَىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/feda8ba1fe4c6d5bf81a.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so he/it guided", "bs": "pa je uputio", "tr": "böylece yol gösterdi", "fr": "alors il a guidé", "id": "maka dia telah memberi petunjuk", "ur": "پس اُس نے ہدایت دی", "bn": "অতঃপর সে পথ দেখাল", "fa": "پس هدایت کرد"}}]}, {"ref": "4:68", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/561.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And should guide them unto a straight path.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ve onları elbette doğru yola iletirdik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ضرور ان کو سیدھی راہ کی ہدایت کرتے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan pasti Kami tunjuki mereka kepada jalan yang lurus.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَهَدَيْنَٰهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c4a6133c8abece6f2f52.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i uputili bismo ih", "en": "and We would have guided them", "tr": "ve onları iletirdik", "fr": "et Nous les aurions guidés", "id": "dan pasti Kami tunjuki mereka", "ur": "اور ہم انہیں ضرور دکھاتے", "bn": "এবং আমরা অবশ্যই তাদের পথ দেখাতাম", "fa": "و به‌یقین آنان را هدایت می‌کردیم"}}, {"text": "صِرَٰطًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّسْتَقِيمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:181", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1135.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And of those whom We created there is a nation who guide with the Truth and establish justice therewith.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Yine bizim yarattığımız insanlardan öyle bir ümmet var ki, onlar hakka yol gösterirler ve o hak ile adaleti yerine getirirler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ہمارے بنائے ہوؤں میں ایک گروہ وہ ہے کہ حق بتائیں اور اس پر انصاف کریں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan di antara orang-orang yang Kami ciptakan ada umat yang memberi petunjuk dengan hak, dan dengan yang hak itu (pula) mereka menjalankan keadilan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمِمَّنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَلَقْنَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُمَّةٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَهْدُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6a9e72c5b1e2d61f5d37.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they guide", "bs": "upućuju", "tr": "yol gösterirler", "fr": "ils guident", "id": "mereka memberi petunjuk", "ur": "وہ ہدایت دیتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা পথ দেখায়", "fa": "هدایت می‌کنند"}}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَبِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": 